# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Character design / SVG rendering assets.
# NOTE: src/ imports SOME of these at build time via Vite (?raw / ?url), so
# those specific files MUST be committed or the production build fails.
# We ignore the bulky reference material but keep what the build needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# melda / style-guide are not imported by src -> keep fully ignored.
melda/
style-guide/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# gypsa/
#
# Rules:
#   - gypsa/ root: track everything (only a handful of files live here)
#   - gypsa/Approved Reference/: track everything (current canon docs + images)
#   - Everything else (subdirectories, working renders, exploration material)
#     is ignored EXCEPT the specific files imported by the build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore all subdirectories by default.
gypsa/Exploration/
gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/
gypsa/Rendering/
gypsa/Original ChatGPT renders/
gypsa/Rejected Drawings/
gypsa/output/
gypsa/tools/

# --- Root gypsa/ images imported by EvolutionOfGypsa (already tracked; listed
#     here for clarity — no explicit un-ignore needed since root is not ignored)

# --- Exploration images imported by EvolutionOfGypsa ---
!gypsa/Exploration/
gypsa/Exploration/**
!gypsa/Exploration/Head/
!gypsa/Exploration/Head/Head Design Exploration - Phase 1.png
!gypsa/Exploration/Eyes/
!gypsa/Exploration/Eyes/Gypsa Canonical Eye Reference.png
!gypsa/Exploration/Hair/
!gypsa/Exploration/Hair/Gypsa Forehead and Crown Fur Reference.png

# --- Archived reference images imported by EvolutionOfGypsa ---
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/
gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/**
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Canonical Backpack Reference.png
