!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Canonical Muzzle.png
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Canonical Neutral Tail Reference.png
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Canonical Walking Stick Reference.png
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Character Sheet v2.0.png
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Provisional Full Body Back Pose.png
!gypsa/Older Reference Revisions/Approved References as of 20261026/Gypsa Provisional Full Body Front Pose.png
