# forest/ is small and its markdown is imported by src -> keep it in the repo.
# (no ignore rule for forest/)

# Loose top-level design docs & reference images.
# The two below are imported by src/ so they MUST stay tracked; ignore the rest.
/*.png
/*.md
!/Friendly Forest Locations.md
!/friendly-forest-principles.md
.agents